# graphify knowledge graph — stays local, deliberately. Upstream suggests
# committing it, but this repo ships graphify-read-guard (opencode-enabled),
# which gates source reads on `graphify-out/graph.json` existing and nothing
# else — committing a graph would silently make every contributor run graphify
# queries before they could read a file. See docs/reference/hooks.md.
graphify-out/
.devexp/health-baseline.json
.devexp/system-health-review.md

# macOS Finder metadata — never useful in a commit, and rsync already
# excludes it from the staged assets (scripts/stage-assets.sh).
.DS_Store
